cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HPI-CT, please cite it as below."
title: "HPI-CT: Healthcare Program Integrity Control Toolkit"
abstract: "A free, open internal-control framework and toolkit that helps healthcare payers, providers, and program-integrity agencies find and close the control gaps that fraud, waste, and abuse exploit before payment. Aligned to the GAO Green Book (2025) and cross-referenced to COSO by principle number; grounded in 877 coded U.S. DOJ healthcare-fraud enforcement actions. Screening and checking were done with AI agents on one model; this is internal checking, not independent review."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nyarko
    given-names: Nicholas
    email: nicholasnyarko@gmail.com
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
